 "tolerance_notes": "Every event is checked against its place (ground distance; 0.5 degree of arc unless it says), height (5 nautical miles), space-fixed speed (50 ft/s), flight-path angle and heading (1 degree). Coasts land on the report's next state, so the gaps that remain are the burns' and the profiles'.",
